$-- Talk list for a `type: custom` listing (see README, "Talks listing").
$-- Each item reads custom fields from its page's `listing-item: extra:`:
$-- `when` and `event` (shown on the meta line), and optional `kind`,
$-- `language` and `summary`.
::: {.list .gw-talk-list}
$for(items)$
::: {.gw-talk-item}
[$it.title$]($it.path$){.gw-talk-title}$if(it.kind)$ [$it.kind$]{.gw-talk-kind}$endif$$if(it.language)$ [$it.language$]{.gw-talk-lang}$endif$

$if(it.summary)$
[$it.summary$]{.gw-talk-summary}

$endif$
[$if(it.when)$$it.when$$endif$$if(it.event)$ · $it.event$$endif$]{.gw-talk-meta}
:::

$endfor$
:::
